        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John D. Rockefeller III, David Rockefeller, Blanchette Ferry Hooker, John D. Rockefeller Jr., Abby Aldrich Rockefeller, John D. Rockefeller, Laura Spelman Rockefeller, Jay Rockefeller\n- Roles: philanthropists, banker, chairman, chief executive, wife, mother, son, grandson\n\nFacts:\n- Blanchette Ferry Hooker was born on October 2, 1909.\n- David Rockefeller was born on June 12, 1915.\n- John D. Rockefeller III was the eldest son of philanthropists John D. Rockefeller Jr. and Abby Aldrich Rockefeller.\n- David Rockefeller was a son of John D. Rockefeller Jr. and Abby Aldrich Rockefeller.\n- David Rockefeller was a grandson of John D. Rockefeller and Laura Spelman Rockefeller.\n- Blanchette Ferry Hooker was the wife of John D. Rockefeller III and the mother of Jay Rockefeller.\n- David Rockefeller was an American banker who was chairman and chief executive of Chase Manhattan Corporation.\n- Blanchette Ferry Hooker died on November 29, 1992.\n- David Rockefeller died on March 20, 2017.",
